        "Description": "Good morning 47. Your targets consist of numerous influential members of the fashion world. The targets are Sanguine CEOs Viktor Novikov and Dalia Margolis, fashion designer Sebastian Seto, and supermodels Helmut Kruger and Madison Lang. Eliminating these targets will give our client the opportunity to steal the spotlight from their biggest rival. I shall leave you prepare.",
